<https://moosedev.dev/kg/Alternative/bfaac061-6b72-4539-aed8-cddbdab4d102> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "Fold a few tree-sitter positions into the single 40-position SCIP sample so one fixture literally contains both modes — rejected: churns the deliberately suffix-stable SCIP fixture (AD d91288c9) for no added assurance; the two-fixture split already exercises both modes, documents the mode per fixture, and lets tree-sitter carry a stricter 100% bar independent of the 95% SCIP bar" <https://moosedev.dev/kg/project> .
