<https://moosedev.dev/kg/Alternative/c01d4d21-b8ab-4950-9552-28751fbfd383> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "Store full rust-analyzer cargo SCIP symbol strings in the fixture — rejected because the embedded crate version changes on version bumps and would create noisy fixture churn unrelated to resolver correctness." <https://moosedev.dev/kg/project> .
