<https://moosedev.dev/kg/ArchitecturalDecision/007dce15-98de-4494-8c64-1729d9e93d66> <https://trivyn.io/ontologies/software/architecture#hasTimestamp> "2026-07-15T16:52:15.837306Z"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#dateTime> <https://moosedev.dev/kg/project> .
