<https://moosedev.dev/kg/ArchitecturalDecision/00b04a90-f327-44d4-bff2-a019befb06a4> <https://trivyn.io/ontologies/software/architecture#hasDescription> "Claim: the judgment+observation strata slice (design ADs 8dd7da0c sidecar, 47620cf2 queue, a557bd33 confidence gate, 642b09ba scope/abstention, 0aa98fe1 silence amendment; Constraints 4879b25c proposed-never-gates, 162a5530 symbolic-only) meets its proposed acceptance criteria, verified on the real repo 2026-07-13. This slice has no spec §7 entry — these criteria are the recorded spec amendment. (1) Observation stratum: moosedev index writes churn.json (318 files, 24-month window) anchored to indexed_commit; non-git dirs degrade to a warning (regression-tested); meta schema stays 2, no substrate invalidated. (2) Full accounting: the live dry-run accounted for every debt-surface role-bearing entity — 88 role + 47 criticality judgments, 312 unclassified-with-reason, 1,655 excluded by kind as groups, 75 missing entities honestly flagged (minted, then 155 judgments applied) — with projected quad growth printed (~1,705, +8.9% on 19.2k). (3) Advisory-until-ratified: after apply, 155 nodes at proposed, zero playsRole/hasCriticality edges, validate_project 0 violations, and the gate on AppState (fan-in 506, the classifier's own top pick) returned ALLOW while the criticality-high judgment was merely proposed. (4) Never-nudge: pending_ratifications reports 25 (links+records only) with '155 judgment proposal(s) waiting quietly'; the LSP nudge count excludes all judgments (tested). (5) Ratification: accepting the AppState criticality judgment via the API materialized exactly one hasCriticality edge and flipped the gate to require_ratification citing 'criticality: high (ratified judgment)' with a gate-fire logged; accepting a core-algorithm role ticked /debt's additive core column to 0/1 (undocumented — honest). (6) Surfaces: the hover dossier renders '- criticality: high — ratified 2026-07-13 by moosedev-classifier', the '⚠ core entity — no linked rationale' hotspot line, and the observations digest 'churn: 14 commits/24mo · last 2026-07-12 · 1 author(s) · top 100%'; proposed judgments render as 'target? (proposed, conf, disposition)'; lens badges (glue?/critical) regression-tested via the raw LSP client. (7) Suites at acceptance: policy 10, proposals 4, classify 2 (+4 rule-table units), grounded_capture 6, debt 1, api 26, mcp_replies 3, lsp_diagnostics 15, both-hosts 1, lib 149, substrate 55+; clippy clean on all new files. Remaining manual step: Zed lens visual + workbench batch-triage click-through (group Accept-all/Reject-all) by the maintainer." <https://moosedev.dev/kg/project> .
