<https://moosedev.dev/kg/ArchitecturalDecision/0c260877-1842-436e-a85a-c9914e506297> <https://trivyn.io/ontologies/software/architecture#concerns> <https://moosedev.dev/kg/SystemComponent/11e01ea2-f520-4f7c-a165-09532dacd43f> <https://moosedev.dev/kg/project> .
