<https://moosedev.dev/kg/ArchitecturalDecision/1b590815-c9ab-4fff-b2a6-69df3ba7c997> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "Code-layer vocabulary: separate software-code ontology module, v2.0 core + parked classes" <https://moosedev.dev/kg/project> .
