<https://moosedev.dev/kg/ArchitecturalDecision/1b78405e-40bb-4c50-a75a-ef7e159bca20> <https://trivyn.io/ontologies/software/architecture#concerns> <https://moosedev.dev/kg/CodeEntity/7e46131e-50cc-4b86-9207-e0aeb116745d> <https://moosedev.dev/kg/project> .
