<https://moosedev.dev/kg/ArchitecturalDecision/1b78405e-40bb-4c50-a75a-ef7e159bca20> <https://trivyn.io/ontologies/software/architecture#hasAuthor> "phase7-acceptance" <https://moosedev.dev/kg/project> .
<https://moosedev.dev/kg/ArchitecturalDecision/1b78405e-40bb-4c50-a75a-ef7e159bca20> <https://trivyn.io/ontologies/software/architecture#hasDescription> "Empirical ground truth (scip-typescript 0.4.0, verified on ui/ plus a controlled exported-vs-private fixture): export-ness is not represented anywhere in the emitted index — exported and non-exported top-level declarations are byte-identical apart from the name; signature_documentation, kind, display_name, and enclosing_symbol are all empty; the only per-symbol metadata is a ts-fenced declaration in documentation[0]. Decision: is_public for scip-typescript = non-local symbol whose ancestor descriptors are all Namespace and whose last descriptor is not Namespace (a top-level module-scoped declaration). This is a documented over-approximation: private top-level declarations batch-mint too; members and parameters stay lazy-mint-only. Display names fall back to the last descriptor name; signatures are extracted from the ts fence, gated on the producer so rust-analyzer doc comments can never leak into signatures." <https://moosedev.dev/kg/project> .
<https://moosedev.dev/kg/ArchitecturalDecision/1b78405e-40bb-4c50-a75a-ef7e159bca20> <https://trivyn.io/ontologies/software/architecture#hasLifecycleStatus> "superseded" <https://moosedev.dev/kg/project> .
