<https://moosedev.dev/kg/ArchitecturalDecision/282378cd-4282-4ece-ae47-a391762f1c80> <https://trivyn.io/ontologies/software/architecture#weighs> <https://moosedev.dev/kg/Alternative/6fbea0ab-a51e-4e7e-a73f-bdcc6f9151b5> <https://moosedev.dev/kg/project> .
<https://moosedev.dev/kg/ArchitecturalDecision/282378cd-4282-4ece-ae47-a391762f1c80> <https://trivyn.io/ontologies/software/architecture#weighs> <https://moosedev.dev/kg/Alternative/c48a9b9e-b666-4c79-8a44-08a23d094316> <https://moosedev.dev/kg/project> .
