<https://moosedev.dev/kg/ArchitecturalDecision/2a778f74-725f-4cd7-a389-52f51888795e> <https://trivyn.io/ontologies/software/architecture#resultsIn> <https://moosedev.dev/kg/Consequence/d7ea56d3-a8ef-4dfa-b18b-f28d4ab79458> <https://moosedev.dev/kg/project> .
<https://moosedev.dev/kg/ArchitecturalDecision/2a778f74-725f-4cd7-a389-52f51888795e> <https://trivyn.io/ontologies/software/architecture#weighs> <https://moosedev.dev/kg/Alternative/b9de95d5-fab2-4b23-ab4c-86759e5f6912> <https://moosedev.dev/kg/project> .
<https://moosedev.dev/kg/ArchitecturalDecision/2ba69b1b-4730-42c2-9518-fb804ec7fd90> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <https://trivyn.io/ontologies/software/architecture#ArchitecturalDecision> <https://moosedev.dev/kg/project> .
<https://moosedev.dev/kg/ArchitecturalDecision/2ba69b1b-4730-42c2-9518-fb804ec7fd90> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "v2.1 ships role-independent; judgment stratum deferred to v2.2 with its writer" <https://moosedev.dev/kg/project> .
<https://moosedev.dev/kg/ArchitecturalDecision/2ba69b1b-4730-42c2-9518-fb804ec7fd90> <https://trivyn.io/ontologies/software/architecture#concerns> <https://moosedev.dev/kg/SystemComponent/6baa075c-db0d-48e0-800a-0cae86603b2a> <https://moosedev.dev/kg/project> .
<https://moosedev.dev/kg/ArchitecturalDecision/2ba69b1b-4730-42c2-9518-fb804ec7fd90> <https://trivyn.io/ontologies/software/architecture#concerns> <https://moosedev.dev/kg/SystemComponent/accf4f9f-6309-4d3f-8705-26e551824eb0> <https://moosedev.dev/kg/project> .
<https://moosedev.dev/kg/ArchitecturalDecision/2ba69b1b-4730-42c2-9518-fb804ec7fd90> <https://trivyn.io/ontologies/software/architecture#hasAuthor> "James" <https://moosedev.dev/kg/project> .
<https://moosedev.dev/kg/ArchitecturalDecision/2ba69b1b-4730-42c2-9518-fb804ec7fd90> <https://trivyn.io/ontologies/software/architecture#hasDescription> "Claim: the v2.1 ambient-layer + debt-metric slice ships WITHOUT the role/criticality judgment stratum (parked per AD 1b590815). Rationale: the judgment stratum's first real writer is v2.2's evidence-based auto-classifier, which needs v2.2's churn/defect observations to classify honestly; nobody hand-classifies entity roles as a workflow, so un-parking the stratum in v2.1 would be writer-less scaffolding — the same anti-pattern the spec applied when it deferred fires.jsonl to v2.2 (AD 365adb90: \"a writer with no writers is dead scaffolding\"). v2.1 therefore delivers only the parts that have real writers now: public-surface why-coverage (role-independent, computed from the substrate's is_public), count/hotspot code lens (NO role badges), the ratification inbox + accept/reject loop, the pending-ratifications nudge, and the citation-seed migration that populates the inbox. Moved to v2.2 (out of the spec's v2.1 letter): role/criticality lens badges and role-weighted why-coverage. Everything built in v2.1 is durable and directly reused by v2.2 — nothing is a stopgap; the public-surface why-coverage is a permanent, objective facet that v2.2's role-weighted view supplements rather than replaces. Conscious spec amendment, user-confirmed 2026-07-12." <https://moosedev.dev/kg/project> .
<https://moosedev.dev/kg/ArchitecturalDecision/2ba69b1b-4730-42c2-9518-fb804ec7fd90> <https://trivyn.io/ontologies/software/architecture#hasLifecycleStatus> "accepted" <https://moosedev.dev/kg/project> .
<https://moosedev.dev/kg/ArchitecturalDecision/2ba69b1b-4730-42c2-9518-fb804ec7fd90> <https://trivyn.io/ontologies/software/architecture#hasTimestamp> "2026-07-13T05:27:45.939872Z"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#dateTime> <https://moosedev.dev/kg/project> .
