<https://moosedev.dev/kg/ArchitecturalDecision/2c3df989-a6bd-4b0e-864f-911565069dce> <https://trivyn.io/ontologies/software/architecture#hasDescription> "Claim: the Story feature specification is approved for implementation by the project owner on 2026-08-13. The approved hub cluster is Requirement https://moosedev.dev/kg/Requirement/ef049631-ecb9-4b83-91bd-0555fa09d45d, Constraint https://moosedev.dev/kg/Constraint/66d15437-2afd-4459-9707-d7e5c5423fa6, and ArchitecturalDecision https://moosedev.dev/kg/ArchitecturalDecision/768665cb-8f3a-4a9b-b89b-b83903050dea. Implementation must follow the repository spec and this graph cluster; the graph wins if the prose diverges.\n\nspec-approval: spec/MOOSEDev_story_spec.md" <https://moosedev.dev/kg/project> .
