<https://moosedev.dev/kg/ArchitecturalDecision/2d11f524-8109-4b90-990b-90d9d9919ad9> <https://trivyn.io/ontologies/software/architecture#hasDescription> "Fixed — the root cause was cards carrying everything *except* the decision content. Refresh the Ratifications page to see the difference. Four changes, all verified live:\n\nGrounded capture at a decision point (proposed; ratify or reject in the workbench inbox).\n\nFiles changed: .claude/hooks/moosedev-capture.sh, .moosedev/kg.nq, clients/nvim/README.md, clients/nvim/conformance.lua, clients/nvim/conformance.sh, clients/nvim/moosedev.lua, src/api/handlers/proposals.rs, src/api/models.rs, src/graph/context.rs, src/graph/grounded_capture.rs, src/graph/proposals.rs, src/lsp/mod.rs, tests/lsp_code_actions.rs, tests/lsp_diagnostics.rs, tests/lsp_transport.rs, tests/lsp_write_path.rs, tests/proposals.rs, ui/dist/index.html, ui/src/api/types.ts, ui/src/pages/RatificationsPage.tsx." <https://moosedev.dev/kg/project> .
<https://moosedev.dev/kg/ArchitecturalDecision/2d11f524-8109-4b90-990b-90d9d9919ad9> <https://trivyn.io/ontologies/software/architecture#hasLifecycleStatus> "rejected" <https://moosedev.dev/kg/project> .
