<https://moosedev.dev/kg/ArchitecturalDecision/33d9ad51-8ed9-4fbd-a76c-69d9d09e3157> <https://trivyn.io/ontologies/software/architecture#hasAuthor> "codex" <https://moosedev.dev/kg/project> .
<https://moosedev.dev/kg/ArchitecturalDecision/33d9ad51-8ed9-4fbd-a76c-69d9d09e3157> <https://trivyn.io/ontologies/software/architecture#hasDescription> "Story generation uses four deterministic subject-family planners: SystemComponent, InformationRecord, CodeEntity, and bounded free-form Topic. Entity Stories resolve an exact current typed graph node. Topic Stories reuse the existing relevant_context retrieval path and persist the normalized query plus explicit evidence/code references; they do not mint Topic ontology nodes. The workbench exposes separate Entity and Topic modes, with server-owned grouped entity search. Recipes use a versioned discriminated subject and read legacy subject_component_iri recipes as component subjects. LLM assistance may rewrite only closed-evidence beat prose; all structure, grounding, lifecycle, checks, and curation remain symbolic or human-owned." <https://moosedev.dev/kg/project> .
<https://moosedev.dev/kg/ArchitecturalDecision/33d9ad51-8ed9-4fbd-a76c-69d9d09e3157> <https://trivyn.io/ontologies/software/architecture#hasLifecycleStatus> "superseded" <https://moosedev.dev/kg/project> .
