<https://moosedev.dev/kg/ArchitecturalDecision/36126fd6-5d2d-4629-b106-604b9bbae8c2> <https://trivyn.io/ontologies/software/architecture#concerns> <https://moosedev.dev/kg/SystemComponent/3193c9a7-8f50-4af0-b0b6-f05ebaa23393> <https://moosedev.dev/kg/project> .
<https://moosedev.dev/kg/ArchitecturalDecision/36126fd6-5d2d-4629-b106-604b9bbae8c2> <https://trivyn.io/ontologies/software/architecture#hasAuthor> "codex" <https://moosedev.dev/kg/project> .
<https://moosedev.dev/kg/ArchitecturalDecision/36126fd6-5d2d-4629-b106-604b9bbae8c2> <https://trivyn.io/ontologies/software/architecture#hasDescription> "Release builds must check out the private MOOSE engine at immutable commit e062d272a3b34ad1abe160e8a5830b48c87f0234 (tagged v0.9.1) for MOOSEDev v0.10.0, rather than resolving the moving default branch. MOOSEDev consumes MOOSE through an unversioned sibling path dependency, so Cargo.lock cannot make that input reproducible; pinning the workflow checkout makes a tag rebuild use the same engine source." <https://moosedev.dev/kg/project> .
<https://moosedev.dev/kg/ArchitecturalDecision/36126fd6-5d2d-4629-b106-604b9bbae8c2> <https://trivyn.io/ontologies/software/architecture#hasLifecycleStatus> "accepted" <https://moosedev.dev/kg/project> .
