<https://moosedev.dev/kg/ArchitecturalDecision/3b0c7d59-4c0d-4b3f-8250-3cb98d893840> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <https://trivyn.io/ontologies/software/architecture#ArchitecturalDecision> <https://moosedev.dev/kg/project> .
<https://moosedev.dev/kg/ArchitecturalDecision/3b0c7d59-4c0d-4b3f-8250-3cb98d893840> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "Unratified knowledge is invisible outside the inbox — working-set discipline at every reader and writer" <https://moosedev.dev/kg/project> .
<https://moosedev.dev/kg/ArchitecturalDecision/3b0c7d59-4c0d-4b3f-8250-3cb98d893840> <https://trivyn.io/ontologies/software/architecture#concerns> <https://moosedev.dev/kg/CodeEntity/cedfab8f-62b2-492f-83e7-2214f04b2bef> <https://moosedev.dev/kg/project> .
<https://moosedev.dev/kg/ArchitecturalDecision/3b0c7d59-4c0d-4b3f-8250-3cb98d893840> <https://trivyn.io/ontologies/software/architecture#concerns> <https://moosedev.dev/kg/CodeEntity/db4ca1dd-1e60-4780-b824-bd10860c1886> <https://moosedev.dev/kg/project> .
<https://moosedev.dev/kg/ArchitecturalDecision/3b0c7d59-4c0d-4b3f-8250-3cb98d893840> <https://trivyn.io/ontologies/software/architecture#concerns> <https://moosedev.dev/kg/SystemComponent/11e01ea2-f520-4f7c-a165-09532dacd43f> <https://moosedev.dev/kg/project> .
<https://moosedev.dev/kg/ArchitecturalDecision/3b0c7d59-4c0d-4b3f-8250-3cb98d893840> <https://trivyn.io/ontologies/software/architecture#concerns> <https://moosedev.dev/kg/SystemComponent/6baa075c-db0d-48e0-800a-0cae86603b2a> <https://moosedev.dev/kg/project> .
<https://moosedev.dev/kg/ArchitecturalDecision/3b0c7d59-4c0d-4b3f-8250-3cb98d893840> <https://trivyn.io/ontologies/software/architecture#hasAuthor> "claude-code" <https://moosedev.dev/kg/project> .
<https://moosedev.dev/kg/ArchitecturalDecision/3b0c7d59-4c0d-4b3f-8250-3cb98d893840> <https://trivyn.io/ontologies/software/architecture#hasDescription> "Claim (from the 2026-07-14 six-finding branch review): a record at lifecycle status `proposed` or `rejected` exists ONLY in the ratification inbox and the audit trail — it must not reach any authoritative surface. Enforced at each reader and writer (Lesson 18eb2f40): (1) `relevant_context` (list-all, topic seed, and relational expansion) and the code-action `link_candidates` filter to the working set via the new `lifecycle::in_working_set` (excludes proposed/rejected/superseded/deprecated; status-less legacy records stay in); `include_history` opts into everything, and pending proposals belong to `pending_ratifications`, not recall. (2) `accept_proposal` on a Link refuses a still-`proposed` subject record (\"ratify the record first, then its links\") — this AMENDS Consequence 34b00cc0 of AD 6255d815: ratification order is record-then-links, no longer the human's free choice, because a materialized edge from an unratified record would smuggle it into dossiers and why-coverage past the inbox. (3) Judgment-axis exclusivity moved into `propose_judgment` itself (the submission layer every path shares — LSP executeCommand, classifier, recategorize): an axis with an accepted judgment, or a pending one with a different target, refuses new proposals (maxCount 1 means they could never be ratified); identical pending twins still dedup. (4) `recategorize_judgment` guards before any write (same-target → \"accept it instead\"; ratified axis → refuse), then settles the axis: rejects the original (and any pending axis twins) BEFORE minting the human-authored correction, so the correction always carries the human's provenance and the old accept-then-fail-to-reject mutation path is gone. Also from the review: the capture hook stamps its debounce only on a confirmed 2xx (curl --fail — an HTTP error must not suppress retries of the same change set), and the LSP proposeLink command validates that targetSymbol resolves to a workspace definition whose file matches targetPath (a bogus symbol would queue a permanently unratifiable proposal). Live effect on this repo: the ~17 legacy records still at `proposed` (bench-era Lessons + wedge AD b3b84af1) drop out of default recall until triaged in the inbox — the honest reading of their status." <https://moosedev.dev/kg/project> .
<https://moosedev.dev/kg/ArchitecturalDecision/3b0c7d59-4c0d-4b3f-8250-3cb98d893840> <https://trivyn.io/ontologies/software/architecture#hasLifecycleStatus> "accepted" <https://moosedev.dev/kg/project> .
