<https://moosedev.dev/kg/ArchitecturalDecision/406b05f7-7cb2-413f-afa1-e91a68eaaf47> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <https://trivyn.io/ontologies/software/architecture#ArchitecturalDecision> <https://moosedev.dev/kg/project> .
<https://moosedev.dev/kg/ArchitecturalDecision/406b05f7-7cb2-413f-afa1-e91a68eaaf47> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "approve-spec first use registered: cloud-tier in trivyn-trial (2026-08-11)" <https://moosedev.dev/kg/project> .
<https://moosedev.dev/kg/ArchitecturalDecision/406b05f7-7cb2-413f-afa1-e91a68eaaf47> <https://trivyn.io/ontologies/software/architecture#concerns> <https://moosedev.dev/kg/SystemComponent/ce49a867-7ebc-41d5-879c-fa59eed3ae65> <https://moosedev.dev/kg/project> .
<https://moosedev.dev/kg/ArchitecturalDecision/406b05f7-7cb2-413f-afa1-e91a68eaaf47> <https://trivyn.io/ontologies/software/architecture#hasAuthor> "claude-code" <https://moosedev.dev/kg/project> .
<https://moosedev.dev/kg/ArchitecturalDecision/406b05f7-7cb2-413f-afa1-e91a68eaaf47> <https://trivyn.io/ontologies/software/architecture#hasDescription> "First production use of the approve-spec workflow: James ran it in trivyn-trial on 2026-08-11 (event window 19:46-19:49Z) against `spec/cloud-tier.md`, to begin implementation of the cloud-tier spec. This record is the per-use registration the skill's trial guardrail requires (date, spec, store, hub baseline, record count); it was written retroactively on 2026-08-12 after a post-restoration capture check surfaced the batch.\n\nSanction: incident-2026-08-capture-regression.md section 11 (2026-08-10) applied the v2 CLAUDE.md guidance, including the approve-spec bullet, to trivyn only, judging it near-free for the trial: the ten trivyn probes are frozen and content-specific to pre-trial history, and P1 (isMotivatedBy recovery, AD c3aa0e1c) is not measurable at trivyn's capture volume. The Aug-24 boundary continues to govern moose (guidance patch staged, unapplied) and the ruling-2 tool-metadata affordances.\n\nRegistration data: spec `spec/cloud-tier.md` (trivyn repo; marker \"spec-approval: spec/cloud-tier.md\" in trivyn-trial). Records minted 2026-08-11T19:46-19:49Z, all claude-code-authored: 5 Requirements + 10 Constraints + 10 ArchitecturalDecisions + 1 approval AD = 26. Hub set (Requirement + Constraint) 84 -> 99 (Requirements 42 -> 47, Constraints 42 -> 52); pre-batch count matches the 2026-08-10 baseline measurement exactly.\n\nEra consequence for trial readouts: trivyn-trial's restored-era capture (2026-08-10 -> Aug 24 month-2 batch) contains one enhanced-workflow batch, so month-2/3 capture-quality metrics for trivyn must decompose organic vs spec-batch records (first two days organic-only: isMotivatedBy 3/5 ADs, vs 10/16 with the batch included). moose-trial remains the clean attribution cell for P1." <https://moosedev.dev/kg/project> .
<https://moosedev.dev/kg/ArchitecturalDecision/406b05f7-7cb2-413f-afa1-e91a68eaaf47> <https://trivyn.io/ontologies/software/architecture#hasLifecycleStatus> "accepted" <https://moosedev.dev/kg/project> .
<https://moosedev.dev/kg/ArchitecturalDecision/406b05f7-7cb2-413f-afa1-e91a68eaaf47> <https://trivyn.io/ontologies/software/architecture#hasRationale> <https://moosedev.dev/kg/Rationale/e25d9f62-652e-47af-880d-66a451bc838b> <https://moosedev.dev/kg/project> .
<https://moosedev.dev/kg/ArchitecturalDecision/406b05f7-7cb2-413f-afa1-e91a68eaaf47> <https://trivyn.io/ontologies/software/architecture#hasTimestamp> "2026-08-13T00:02:10.742055Z"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#dateTime> <https://moosedev.dev/kg/project> .
<https://moosedev.dev/kg/ArchitecturalDecision/406b05f7-7cb2-413f-afa1-e91a68eaaf47> <https://trivyn.io/ontologies/software/architecture#hasTitle> "approve-spec first use registered: cloud-tier in trivyn-trial (2026-08-11)" <https://moosedev.dev/kg/project> .
<https://moosedev.dev/kg/ArchitecturalDecision/406b05f7-7cb2-413f-afa1-e91a68eaaf47> <https://trivyn.io/ontologies/software/architecture#resultsIn> <https://moosedev.dev/kg/Consequence/57efbac4-a4c3-444c-973d-2935b2721239> <https://moosedev.dev/kg/project> .
<https://moosedev.dev/kg/ArchitecturalDecision/406b05f7-7cb2-413f-afa1-e91a68eaaf47> <https://trivyn.io/ontologies/software/architecture#supersedes> <https://moosedev.dev/kg/ArchitecturalDecision/538d7f7a-f432-4164-b417-9f8e03fa552a> <https://moosedev.dev/kg/project> .
<https://moosedev.dev/kg/ArchitecturalDecision/411161e1-0294-4ea2-93c0-b78c097fef8b> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <https://trivyn.io/ontologies/software/architecture#ArchitecturalDecision> <https://moosedev.dev/kg/project> .
<https://moosedev.dev/kg/ArchitecturalDecision/411161e1-0294-4ea2-93c0-b78c097fef8b> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "Python substrate support: canonicalized module markers, py+pyi full ladder" <https://moosedev.dev/kg/project> .
<https://moosedev.dev/kg/ArchitecturalDecision/411161e1-0294-4ea2-93c0-b78c097fef8b> <https://trivyn.io/ontologies/software/architecture#hasAuthor> "claude-code" <https://moosedev.dev/kg/project> .
<https://moosedev.dev/kg/ArchitecturalDecision/411161e1-0294-4ea2-93c0-b78c097fef8b> <https://trivyn.io/ontologies/software/architecture#hasDescription> "Claim: Python support is the full honest-degradation ladder — a scip-python producer plus a tree-sitter-python fallback covering both .py and .pyi — with scip-python's module idiom canonicalized at ingest. Realizes AD 45f39df4 via AD 256e5702's mechanism. Detection: root markers pyproject.toml / setup.py / setup.cfg / requirements.txt; first-sorted-subdir scan accepts only the strong markers (tooling-only requirements.txt like moosedev's bench/requirements.txt must not spawn scip-python). Command mirrors scip-typescript: npx --yes @sourcegraph/scip-python index --output <tmp>, cwd = project dir, env override MOOSEDEV_SCIP_PYTHON; no --project-name (Constraint 00b3986e elides the git-revision version). Module markers: scip-python renders a module definition as a trailing Meta descriptor (`pkg.mod`/__init__:); ingest rewrites it to the standard namespace module symbol (`pkg.mod`/) via the lang::python canonical_symbol hook, so module classification, display naming (module mints as \"pkg.mod\", never \"__init__\"), logical paths, and the batch-mint module gate all work with zero Python-specific handling downstream — verified live: mint dry-run now creates Module scratch.app. Real __init__ methods/functions are Method descriptors and are never rewritten; a marker with no namespace ancestor is left untouched. Visibility: public ⇔ non-local ∧ top-level ∧ no leading underscore (PEP 8; also excludes top-level dunders); modules fail the top-level gate post-canonicalization and mint through the module path; class members stay lazy-mint-only. Signatures: scip-python leaves signature_documentation empty; the fenced-documentation seam (```python) supplies them. Fallback: tree-sitter-python registered for BOTH py and pyi (stubs are valid Python syntax); anchors function_definition/class_definition only; identities ts:python:<path>:<kind>:<name>; verified live (ts:python:tests/fixtures/ts_fallback.pyi:fn:Widget::render, mode tree-sitter). Accepted consequences carry over from the superseded record: unspecified position_encoding / UTF-16-ish columns on non-ASCII lines (same exposure as scip-typescript, aggregate warning covers it), and npx cold-start + pyright-based indexer weight (mitigated by the debounce, per-producer failure isolation, and the MOOSEDEV_SCIP_PYTHON pin)." <https://moosedev.dev/kg/project> .
<https://moosedev.dev/kg/ArchitecturalDecision/411161e1-0294-4ea2-93c0-b78c097fef8b> <https://trivyn.io/ontologies/software/architecture#hasLifecycleStatus> "superseded" <https://moosedev.dev/kg/project> .
<https://moosedev.dev/kg/ArchitecturalDecision/411161e1-0294-4ea2-93c0-b78c097fef8b> <https://trivyn.io/ontologies/software/architecture#hasRationale> <https://moosedev.dev/kg/Rationale/1e678ee9-5112-4229-a5a8-095879459af0> <https://moosedev.dev/kg/project> .
<https://moosedev.dev/kg/ArchitecturalDecision/411161e1-0294-4ea2-93c0-b78c097fef8b> <https://trivyn.io/ontologies/software/architecture#hasTimestamp> "2026-07-18T22:16:25.554797Z"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#dateTime> <https://moosedev.dev/kg/project> .
