<https://moosedev.dev/kg/ArchitecturalDecision/4729eb4f-c864-4c47-baaf-77bf52e7a602> <https://trivyn.io/ontologies/software/architecture#weighs> <https://moosedev.dev/kg/Alternative/ea239aef-5711-487c-9d6e-c51f97ba15d9> <https://moosedev.dev/kg/project> .
<https://moosedev.dev/kg/ArchitecturalDecision/47620cf2-6b4c-4f28-8d9d-8c9c2da8a560> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <https://trivyn.io/ontologies/software/architecture#ArchitecturalDecision> <https://moosedev.dev/kg/project> .
<https://moosedev.dev/kg/ArchitecturalDecision/47620cf2-6b4c-4f28-8d9d-8c9c2da8a560> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "Judgments ride the ProposedLink queue via proposesTargetIri" <https://moosedev.dev/kg/project> .
<https://moosedev.dev/kg/ArchitecturalDecision/47620cf2-6b4c-4f28-8d9d-8c9c2da8a560> <https://trivyn.io/ontologies/software/architecture#concerns> <https://moosedev.dev/kg/SystemComponent/11e01ea2-f520-4f7c-a165-09532dacd43f> <https://moosedev.dev/kg/project> .
<https://moosedev.dev/kg/ArchitecturalDecision/47620cf2-6b4c-4f28-8d9d-8c9c2da8a560> <https://trivyn.io/ontologies/software/architecture#concerns> <https://moosedev.dev/kg/SystemComponent/8bb903fd-faba-42af-98d1-a953373ef23b> <https://moosedev.dev/kg/project> .
<https://moosedev.dev/kg/ArchitecturalDecision/47620cf2-6b4c-4f28-8d9d-8c9c2da8a560> <https://trivyn.io/ontologies/software/architecture#hasAuthor> "claude-code" <https://moosedev.dev/kg/project> .
<https://moosedev.dev/kg/ArchitecturalDecision/47620cf2-6b4c-4f28-8d9d-8c9c2da8a560> <https://trivyn.io/ontologies/software/architecture#hasDescription> "Claim: role/criticality judgments are ProposedLink nodes whose proposesTargetIri literal names a taxonomy individual (deterministic project-graph IRIs https://moosedev.dev/kg/CodeRole/<role> and …/Criticality/<level>, seeded idempotently by ensure_taxonomy_individuals) — no dedicated Judgment class, no second queue, no new state store (spec §6). The node additionally carries hasConfidence (xsd:decimal) and hasEscalation ('escalated'|'auto-held') literals. ProposalKind::Judgment is detected by the presence of proposesTargetIri. Accept materializes exactly one playing-relation edge (entity playsRole/hasCriticality individual) via the shape-validated relate() — no symbol resolution — and the ACCEPTED node remains as the edge's ratification provenance (author/timestamp/status/confidence/evidence), satisfying spec §3.4's 'playing-relations carrying status and ratification provenance'. Reject flips status only. Literals-only-until-accept preserves the D1 interlock: proposed judgments are invisible to gate/debt and appear in advisory surfaces only. playsRole/hasCriticality are declared WITHOUT owl:inverseOf (unlike realizes) so enrichment cannot materialize hub inverse edges on the nine taxonomy individuals — a direction nothing reads. Shapes: CodeEntityShape gained sh:class branches (maxCount 1 per axis), which is what admits CodeEntity subjects through the relation catalogue; the write path is accept-only. CodeRole and Criticality are un-parked; AttentionPolicy/Observation/CodeSnapshot/AuthorshipProvenance stay parked (AD 8dd7da0c). Cluster-satellite exclusion and the Record kind (v2.2) are unchanged." <https://moosedev.dev/kg/project> .
<https://moosedev.dev/kg/ArchitecturalDecision/47620cf2-6b4c-4f28-8d9d-8c9c2da8a560> <https://trivyn.io/ontologies/software/architecture#hasLifecycleStatus> "accepted" <https://moosedev.dev/kg/project> .
<https://moosedev.dev/kg/ArchitecturalDecision/47620cf2-6b4c-4f28-8d9d-8c9c2da8a560> <https://trivyn.io/ontologies/software/architecture#hasTimestamp> "2026-07-13T20:30:57.169545Z"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#dateTime> <https://moosedev.dev/kg/project> .
