<https://moosedev.dev/kg/ArchitecturalDecision/4d57fbad-f319-4a71-929f-191186e2ba1d> <https://trivyn.io/ontologies/software/architecture#weighs> <https://moosedev.dev/kg/Alternative/504c51b6-9545-4f44-ab85-a71f6b9fef62> <https://moosedev.dev/kg/project> .
