<https://moosedev.dev/kg/ArchitecturalDecision/519c2abc-f5b1-4acd-bed0-ff6815c6f74c> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <https://trivyn.io/ontologies/software/architecture#ArchitecturalDecision> <https://moosedev.dev/kg/project> .
