<https://moosedev.dev/kg/ArchitecturalDecision/519c2abc-f5b1-4acd-bed0-ff6815c6f74c> <https://trivyn.io/ontologies/software/architecture#hasAuthor> "claude-code" <https://moosedev.dev/kg/project> .
<https://moosedev.dev/kg/ArchitecturalDecision/519c2abc-f5b1-4acd-bed0-ff6815c6f74c> <https://trivyn.io/ontologies/software/architecture#hasDescription> "v0.10.0 deployed to both in-anger trial daemons 2026-08-24, between the month-2 and month-3 probe batches, with the capture/recall surface byte-identical to v0.9.0 — so this release does NOT open a capture era: the restored era (AD c3aa0e1c, 2026-08-10+) continues through it, and era 3 opens only with v0.11.0 (the separately registered step-2 release: relate lifecycle-predicate guard, write-path symmetry, sanctioned unflipped-supersession defect repair).\n\nCapture-surface audit of v0.9.0..HEAD (457b8d1): src/mcp/ zero diffs — the restored affordance text ships byte-identical, verified on the built artifact via strings (\"capture its cluster in the SAME call\", \"TRUST it: prefer its recorded answer\"); ontologies/ zero diffs; src/graph/links.rs untouched; src/graph/context.rs is a behavior-preserving refactor (adds read-only relevant_context_snapshot for Story mode; the MCP recall path is identical). Release contents: Story mode (#26, additive read-only projection); MOOSE 0.8.0 compat (#22) — LLM client structured-output support with optional env vars MOOSEDEV_LLM_CONTEXT_WINDOW_TOKENS / MOOSEDEV_LLM_STRUCTURED_OUTPUT (absent = prior behavior), ontology/domain vector store schema v2 (derived rows, regenerated whole on mismatch); dossier/debt/code-entities read-surface updates.\n\nDeployment record: Homebrew artifact sha256 f7d025da22a6f2615d50c11b1c3d86f0ce162dfc865a8c216ef4c8087fb5c076; both daemons restarted from /opt/homebrew/bin/moosedev; canonical startup sync Nothing on both stores (moose-trial 46,612 quads / trivyn-trial 68,640 — kg.nq untouched); ontology vector store rebuilt schema unstamped-to-2 (37 vectors each); instance vectors 0 to embed. A/A retrieval neutrality: pre/post get_relevant_context snapshots on all 16 frozen probes byte-identical, both corpora — pre snapshots were taken against the still-running 0.9.0 daemon images (the 0.9.0 keg had been removed by brew cleanup). Evidence archived at ~/code/moosedev_benches/{trivyn,moose}-trial/aa-v0.10.0-2026-08/{pre,post}. Precedents: binary-upgrade registration AD 62b3d043; measurement-provenance Lessons 2d4ad53a / 3ea68212; maintenance-neutrality pattern of the 2026-07-04 namespace migration. Month-3 stamps epoch 0.10.0+f7d025da unless v0.11.0 deploys first; either way each corpus reads single-epoch." <https://moosedev.dev/kg/project> .
