<https://moosedev.dev/kg/ArchitecturalDecision/53720fee-d7ff-43d3-943f-64acff2fe112> <https://trivyn.io/ontologies/software/architecture#hasAuthor> "codex-mcp-client" <https://moosedev.dev/kg/project> .
<https://moosedev.dev/kg/ArchitecturalDecision/53720fee-d7ff-43d3-943f-64acff2fe112> <https://trivyn.io/ontologies/software/architecture#hasDescription> "Default interactive Story narration uses one deterministic, context-window-aware evidence packet and one structured synthesis call. The daemon groups authoritative evidence into at most twelve server-owned provenance sources, assigns short source IDs, validates their exact union, and expands them back to public evidence IRIs. The prompt budget is one quarter of the configured model context window, capped at 32K estimated tokens; larger providers receive richer complete evidence while the full symbolic dossier remains authoritative and inspectable. Successful validated prose is cached only as disposable presentation state." <https://moosedev.dev/kg/project> .
<https://moosedev.dev/kg/ArchitecturalDecision/53720fee-d7ff-43d3-943f-64acff2fe112> <https://trivyn.io/ontologies/software/architecture#hasLifecycleStatus> "accepted" <https://moosedev.dev/kg/project> .
