<https://moosedev.dev/kg/ArchitecturalDecision/59efbc1b-c151-4905-80a2-eee7e8b812ca> <https://trivyn.io/ontologies/software/architecture#hasDescription> "Claim: proposed supersessions are stored as a non-authoritative replacement+rationale cluster with reified pending relation triples; ratification alone atomically accepts the cluster, materializes semantic and lifecycle links, and retires the predecessor. This prevents direct edges or GROWL inverses from leaking unratified claims while preserving same-call relation selection." <https://moosedev.dev/kg/project> .
