<https://moosedev.dev/kg/ArchitecturalDecision/8555ceeb-6fef-42a2-b868-b14bb09eea06> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "Editor language coverage derives from the lang registry; clients attach broadly" <https://moosedev.dev/kg/project> .
