<https://moosedev.dev/kg/ArchitecturalDecision/8555ceeb-6fef-42a2-b868-b14bb09eea06> <https://trivyn.io/ontologies/software/architecture#hasAuthor> "claude-code" <https://moosedev.dev/kg/project> .
<https://moosedev.dev/kg/ArchitecturalDecision/8555ceeb-6fef-42a2-b868-b14bb09eea06> <https://trivyn.io/ontologies/software/architecture#hasDescription> "Claim: adding a substrate language stays \"one module under src/code/substrate/lang/ plus one LANGUAGES row\" all the way out to the editors — no per-client filetype edits. Mechanism: clients attach with NO language filter (Neovim 0.11 stanza drops `filetypes`, gated by the .moosedev root marker; the VS Code extension uses documentSelector {scheme: \"file\"} gated by workspaceContains:.moosedev; Emacs registrations activate on prog-mode + the root marker) and rely on the server's existing layered silence for non-substrate files (repo-relative-path miss, document_matches_substrate, resolution miss). The single exception is Zed, whose extension.toml bakes language names into the published artifact: those names now live in the registry itself (LanguageSpec.zed_languages) and a cargo unit test string-scans clients/zed/extension.toml, failing the build on drift in either direction. This also closed the concrete gap that motivated it: Python indexing shipped (commit 237c4fe) but no client filetype list mentioned python. Prompted by the maintainer's explicit ask that new languages not require touching clients, substrate/lang, and init generators separately." <https://moosedev.dev/kg/project> .
<https://moosedev.dev/kg/ArchitecturalDecision/8555ceeb-6fef-42a2-b868-b14bb09eea06> <https://trivyn.io/ontologies/software/architecture#hasLifecycleStatus> "accepted" <https://moosedev.dev/kg/project> .
<https://moosedev.dev/kg/ArchitecturalDecision/8555ceeb-6fef-42a2-b868-b14bb09eea06> <https://trivyn.io/ontologies/software/architecture#hasTimestamp> "2026-07-19T04:44:43.03921Z"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#dateTime> <https://moosedev.dev/kg/project> .
<https://moosedev.dev/kg/ArchitecturalDecision/8555ceeb-6fef-42a2-b868-b14bb09eea06> <https://trivyn.io/ontologies/software/architecture#hasTitle> "Editor language coverage derives from the lang registry; clients attach broadly" <https://moosedev.dev/kg/project> .
<https://moosedev.dev/kg/ArchitecturalDecision/8555ceeb-6fef-42a2-b868-b14bb09eea06> <https://trivyn.io/ontologies/software/architecture#resultsIn> <https://moosedev.dev/kg/Consequence/7112d737-8b67-4b89-881b-6921747d7afb> <https://moosedev.dev/kg/project> .
<https://moosedev.dev/kg/ArchitecturalDecision/8555ceeb-6fef-42a2-b868-b14bb09eea06> <https://trivyn.io/ontologies/software/architecture#resultsIn> <https://moosedev.dev/kg/Consequence/ec024009-cf6c-4fdb-af92-39bbb81b5d01> <https://moosedev.dev/kg/project> .
