<https://moosedev.dev/kg/ArchitecturalDecision/9b013ee9-8ede-41fd-a12e-654f515d1bcf> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "NeSy 2026 camera-ready: de-anonymized, review revisions, scoped artifact release" <https://moosedev.dev/kg/project> .
<https://moosedev.dev/kg/ArchitecturalDecision/9b013ee9-8ede-41fd-a12e-654f515d1bcf> <https://trivyn.io/ontologies/software/architecture#hasAuthor> "claude-code" <https://moosedev.dev/kg/project> .
<https://moosedev.dev/kg/ArchitecturalDecision/9b013ee9-8ede-41fd-a12e-654f515d1bcf> <https://trivyn.io/ontologies/software/architecture#hasDescription> "Claim: the camera-ready version of the accepted NeSy 2026 paper (extends AD a4ccb058) was prepared 2026-08-04 on the paper repo's camera_ready branch: de-anonymized per the NOTES.md map (MOOSEDev/MOOSE/Trivyn/CodeGraph restored, real author block), plus all review-driven revisions — a worked neurosymbolic query example in the system section (Reviewer 2's main concern), an explicit scoping sentence tying the \"modeling problem\" claim to structural queries, Table 1 relabeled with condition names, ontology size stated (9+11 classes, 51 properties, 20 SHACL node shapes), a domain-level-portability sentence, KG-in-SE related-work positioning (Abdelaziz K-CAP 2021 toolkit; KCoEvo arXiv:2603.07581 — code KGs model the code, MOOSEDev models the knowledge about it), and an adoption-mitigation sentence. Fitting the 3-4-page body required trims to existing prose (listed in NOTES.md for author review). Sub-decisions (James, 2026-08-04): NO AI-assistance disclosure sentence (verified neither NeSy nor PMLR has any LLM-writing policy; a voluntary line was declined); mem0 stays named (reviewers accepted the paper with it); month-1 trial numbers stay out (reaffirms AD f6055213). Artifact release staged in bench/release/: full codegraph five-arm matrix + moosedev-temporal currency runs + filtered run indexes + corpus exports + scale study (36M, 267 files); trivyn/burrow transcripts withheld as private, and three grep-echo spans of private burrow task notes in one escaping-B0 transcript were redacted with explicit markers disclosed in the release README. Deadlines: registration (early-bird) 2026-08-10, camera-ready upload via EasyChair submission #2 by 2026-08-15 AoE." <https://moosedev.dev/kg/project> .
<https://moosedev.dev/kg/ArchitecturalDecision/9b013ee9-8ede-41fd-a12e-654f515d1bcf> <https://trivyn.io/ontologies/software/architecture#hasLifecycleStatus> "accepted" <https://moosedev.dev/kg/project> .
