<https://moosedev.dev/kg/ArchitecturalDecision/9e4bd610-0d98-406a-a03f-0b426b15fe6a> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "v2.2 active-agency layer passes acceptance" <https://moosedev.dev/kg/project> .
<https://moosedev.dev/kg/ArchitecturalDecision/9e4bd610-0d98-406a-a03f-0b426b15fe6a> <https://trivyn.io/ontologies/software/architecture#concerns> <https://moosedev.dev/kg/SystemComponent/11e01ea2-f520-4f7c-a165-09532dacd43f> <https://moosedev.dev/kg/project> .
