<https://moosedev.dev/kg/ArchitecturalDecision/9e4bd610-0d98-406a-a03f-0b426b15fe6a> <https://trivyn.io/ontologies/software/architecture#hasAuthor> "claude-code" <https://moosedev.dev/kg/project> .
<https://moosedev.dev/kg/ArchitecturalDecision/9e4bd610-0d98-406a-a03f-0b426b15fe6a> <https://trivyn.io/ontologies/software/architecture#hasDescription> "Claim: the v2.2 active-agency slice (scope AD 7dd7d3c6; engine AD a726d76b; gate AD 4d57fbad; capture AD 6255d815) meets the spec §7 v2.2 acceptance test, verified on the real artifact 2026-07-13. (1) One policy drives both hosts: the scripted scenario (tests/policy_both_hosts.rs) proves the identical gate verdict for host=claude-code and host=opencode with one gate-fire each in fires.jsonl; live, the same edit against normalize_symbol (governed by accepted Constraint 00b3986e via constrains) produced require_ratification through BOTH adapter paths — the Claude Code PreToolUse hook (.claude/hooks/moosedev-gate.sh over HTTP, emitting permissionDecision ask; silent exit-0 on an unconstrained file) and the opencode transport (evaluate_policy over moosedev --connect MCP stdio) — each appending its own gate line to .moosedev/fires.jsonl. (2) Push injects the same dossier bytes hover shows: asserted byte-equal in tests (policy.rs, policy_both_hosts.rs vs the get_entity_dossier tool) and live via the PostToolUse push hook returning the normalize_symbol dossier as additionalContext; push-fire logged. (3) Capture produces only proposed records with provenance, never auto-accepted: proven in tests/grounded_capture.rs (proposed-only, provenance stamped, isMotivatedBy link-or-omit, invisible to dossiers and why-coverage until ratified) and live — the Stop hook captured the v2.2 working-tree decision point as a proposed ArchitecturalDecision with 6 queued concerns link proposals, visible in pending_ratifications and the workbench inbox; capture-fire logged with decision=proposed. Live verification also surfaced and fixed a queue-semantics collision: cluster-satellite classes (Alternative/Consequence/Rationale) left at legacy-default proposed status flooded the generalized inbox; they are never independently ratifiable (their lifecycle rides the parent decision), so the queue scan and accept/reject now exclude them (regression test cluster_satellites_are_never_queue_entries). Known residue, deliberately NOT auto-fixed: 16 bench-era Lessons and 1 Constraint sit at legacy-default proposed and now appear in the inbox alongside the deliberately-proposed wedge AD b3b84af1 (evidence-gated — correctly listed); normalizing the legacy ones is the maintainer's call (extend examples/normalize_lifecycle_status.rs beyond AD+Requirement, excluding b3b84af1, or triage via the inbox). Suites green at acceptance: policy 9, grounded_capture 6, proposals 2, policy_both_hosts 1, api 27, mcp_replies 3, lsp_diagnostics 15 (unchanged — the Warn lift is behavior-preserving), init 33; clippy clean on all new files; moosedev init --claude-hooks generates the hook scripts + a non-clobbering settings.json merge, registered live in this repo." <https://moosedev.dev/kg/project> .
