<https://moosedev.dev/kg/ArchitecturalDecision/a138a6fc-f0c4-40cc-90fc-83acc3a551a1> <https://trivyn.io/ontologies/software/architecture#hasDescription> "Claim: one useStoryGeneration hook owns page-level asynchronous Story state and operations behind semantic actions, while StoriesPage retains subject/catalog and rendering concerns. Generation tokens and ownership predicates remain private so callers cannot bypass stale-result protection." <https://moosedev.dev/kg/project> .
