<https://moosedev.dev/kg/ArchitecturalDecision/a18e8885-3bb0-42fc-a2e8-cb84bd1d09dc> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <https://trivyn.io/ontologies/software/architecture#ArchitecturalDecision> <https://moosedev.dev/kg/project> .
<https://moosedev.dev/kg/ArchitecturalDecision/a18e8885-3bb0-42fc-a2e8-cb84bd1d09dc> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "Serialized didSave reindex with detached shutdown" <https://moosedev.dev/kg/project> .
<https://moosedev.dev/kg/ArchitecturalDecision/a18e8885-3bb0-42fc-a2e8-cb84bd1d09dc> <https://trivyn.io/ontologies/software/architecture#concerns> <https://moosedev.dev/kg/SystemComponent/6baa075c-db0d-48e0-800a-0cae86603b2a> <https://moosedev.dev/kg/project> .
<https://moosedev.dev/kg/ArchitecturalDecision/a18e8885-3bb0-42fc-a2e8-cb84bd1d09dc> <https://trivyn.io/ontologies/software/architecture#concerns> <https://moosedev.dev/kg/SystemComponent/accf4f9f-6309-4d3f-8705-26e551824eb0> <https://moosedev.dev/kg/project> .
<https://moosedev.dev/kg/ArchitecturalDecision/a18e8885-3bb0-42fc-a2e8-cb84bd1d09dc> <https://trivyn.io/ontologies/software/architecture#hasAuthor> "codex" <https://moosedev.dev/kg/project> .
<https://moosedev.dev/kg/ArchitecturalDecision/a18e8885-3bb0-42fc-a2e8-cb84bd1d09dc> <https://trivyn.io/ontologies/software/architecture#hasDescription> "Claim: every qualifying textDocument/didSave unconditionally nudges one daemon-global trailing-debounce scheduler, and every daemon, hook, or manual rebuild uses the ordinary waiting per-project index.lock path; no pgrep process scan and no if-idle/skip path may discard required reconciliation. The scheduler retains its quiet window, backstop, single-flight re-arm, and failure cooldown, but shutdown only signals stop and detaches: it never joins a worker that is running or crossing into a producer run. Git post-commit, post-merge, and post-checkout hooks remain asynchronous to Git while their background moosedev index process waits for the repository lock, accepting at most one bounded redundant serialized rebuild instead of losing the newer state. Each successful build publishes an immutable generation only after syncing its artifacts and parent generations directory, then atomically publishes and directory-syncs meta.json. AppState loads exactly the sampled metadata and memoizes a failure against the identity actually attempted. Knowledge-LSP refreshes before every message, pins one Arc<Substrate> per computation, immediately republishes didChange diagnostics, and rebases base_text only from a generation-proven source whose stable stat/read/stat mtime predates indexed_started_at; otherwise coordinate-bearing surfaces remain silent until the next generation." <https://moosedev.dev/kg/project> .
<https://moosedev.dev/kg/ArchitecturalDecision/a18e8885-3bb0-42fc-a2e8-cb84bd1d09dc> <https://trivyn.io/ontologies/software/architecture#hasLifecycleStatus> "accepted" <https://moosedev.dev/kg/project> .
<https://moosedev.dev/kg/ArchitecturalDecision/a18e8885-3bb0-42fc-a2e8-cb84bd1d09dc> <https://trivyn.io/ontologies/software/architecture#hasRationale> <https://moosedev.dev/kg/Rationale/79a78439-165e-4b7c-a3c1-10bd97dd6476> <https://moosedev.dev/kg/project> .
<https://moosedev.dev/kg/ArchitecturalDecision/a18e8885-3bb0-42fc-a2e8-cb84bd1d09dc> <https://trivyn.io/ontologies/software/architecture#hasTimestamp> "2026-07-18T01:27:25.845971Z"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#dateTime> <https://moosedev.dev/kg/project> .
<https://moosedev.dev/kg/ArchitecturalDecision/a18e8885-3bb0-42fc-a2e8-cb84bd1d09dc> <https://trivyn.io/ontologies/software/architecture#hasTitle> "Serialized didSave reindex with detached shutdown" <https://moosedev.dev/kg/project> .
