<https://moosedev.dev/kg/ArchitecturalDecision/a8f95059-d47d-41be-b5f9-6011a9ccad37> <https://trivyn.io/ontologies/software/architecture#concerns> <https://moosedev.dev/kg/CodeEntity/4f656501-e57e-4ec3-a518-57a482255172> <https://moosedev.dev/kg/project> .
<https://moosedev.dev/kg/ArchitecturalDecision/a8f95059-d47d-41be-b5f9-6011a9ccad37> <https://trivyn.io/ontologies/software/architecture#concerns> <https://moosedev.dev/kg/SystemComponent/6baa075c-db0d-48e0-800a-0cae86603b2a> <https://moosedev.dev/kg/project> .
<https://moosedev.dev/kg/ArchitecturalDecision/a8f95059-d47d-41be-b5f9-6011a9ccad37> <https://trivyn.io/ontologies/software/architecture#concerns> <https://moosedev.dev/kg/SystemComponent/accf4f9f-6309-4d3f-8705-26e551824eb0> <https://moosedev.dev/kg/project> .
