<https://moosedev.dev/kg/ArchitecturalDecision/bf838e2e-5320-4df7-8469-883e5b0155d6> <https://trivyn.io/ontologies/software/architecture#concerns> <https://moosedev.dev/kg/CodeEntity/bf05b460-166a-4e43-b5d9-be2d5df42320> <https://moosedev.dev/kg/project> .
