<https://moosedev.dev/kg/ArchitecturalDecision/c94e50a6-d82b-4e70-b949-528c18067304> <https://trivyn.io/ontologies/software/architecture#concerns> <https://moosedev.dev/kg/SystemComponent/19df26dc-076b-4339-bee6-bfdc602c13ff> <https://moosedev.dev/kg/project> .
