<https://moosedev.dev/kg/ArchitecturalDecision/c9874c4c-2e76-41a2-b376-f431f7478c2b> <https://trivyn.io/ontologies/software/architecture#concerns> <https://moosedev.dev/kg/SystemComponent/19df26dc-076b-4339-bee6-bfdc602c13ff> <https://moosedev.dev/kg/project> .
