<https://moosedev.dev/kg/ArchitecturalDecision/d13be5bb-55b0-4ecc-a2c2-78f0ede8f502> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "Substrate storage: raw SCIP index + meta.json, parsed in-memory" <https://moosedev.dev/kg/project> .
<https://moosedev.dev/kg/ArchitecturalDecision/d13be5bb-55b0-4ecc-a2c2-78f0ede8f502> <https://trivyn.io/ontologies/software/architecture#concerns> <https://moosedev.dev/kg/CodeEntity/a83c153a-32cb-4124-9f25-2334b5c06fe8> <https://moosedev.dev/kg/project> .
<https://moosedev.dev/kg/ArchitecturalDecision/d13be5bb-55b0-4ecc-a2c2-78f0ede8f502> <https://trivyn.io/ontologies/software/architecture#concerns> <https://moosedev.dev/kg/SystemComponent/accf4f9f-6309-4d3f-8705-26e551824eb0> <https://moosedev.dev/kg/project> .
<https://moosedev.dev/kg/ArchitecturalDecision/d13be5bb-55b0-4ecc-a2c2-78f0ede8f502> <https://trivyn.io/ontologies/software/architecture#hasAuthor> "claude-code" <https://moosedev.dev/kg/project> .
<https://moosedev.dev/kg/ArchitecturalDecision/d13be5bb-55b0-4ecc-a2c2-78f0ede8f502> <https://trivyn.io/ontologies/software/architecture#hasDescription> "Claim: the substrate persists exactly the producer's raw output (.moosedev/substrate/index.scip) plus a small meta.json (schema_version, indexed_commit, indexed_at, producer, producer_version, mode, counts), and parses the index into memory on load — no database projection. Why: the moosedev repo index is 3.86 MB / 84 documents / 42,234 occurrences and parses in tens of milliseconds, so a persistent query layer buys nothing; keeping the producer artifact canonical means zero format drift between what rust-analyzer emitted and what the resolver serves. Write protocol: emit to index.scip.tmp, parse+validate, fs::rename into place, write meta.json LAST — meta presence signals a complete substrate. Staleness: meta.indexed_commit vs `git rev-parse HEAD`, baked into every Resolution. The in-memory model (producer-agnostic per-file occurrence tables) is the tree-sitter seam: ResolutionMode { Scip, TreeSitter } exists now, only Scip is constructed. Implemented 2026-07-07 (v2.0 slice 1, commit 8019c5a)." <https://moosedev.dev/kg/project> .
<https://moosedev.dev/kg/ArchitecturalDecision/d13be5bb-55b0-4ecc-a2c2-78f0ede8f502> <https://trivyn.io/ontologies/software/architecture#hasLifecycleStatus> "accepted" <https://moosedev.dev/kg/project> .
<https://moosedev.dev/kg/ArchitecturalDecision/d13be5bb-55b0-4ecc-a2c2-78f0ede8f502> <https://trivyn.io/ontologies/software/architecture#hasTimestamp> "2026-07-07T19:19:22.80864Z"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#dateTime> <https://moosedev.dev/kg/project> .
<https://moosedev.dev/kg/ArchitecturalDecision/d13be5bb-55b0-4ecc-a2c2-78f0ede8f502> <https://trivyn.io/ontologies/software/architecture#hasTitle> "Substrate storage: raw SCIP index + meta.json, parsed in-memory" <https://moosedev.dev/kg/project> .
<https://moosedev.dev/kg/ArchitecturalDecision/d13be5bb-55b0-4ecc-a2c2-78f0ede8f502> <https://trivyn.io/ontologies/software/architecture#isMotivatedBy> <https://moosedev.dev/kg/Requirement/350c7f2e-61bd-49e4-b7cd-2fdd3f51f521> <https://moosedev.dev/kg/project> .
<https://moosedev.dev/kg/ArchitecturalDecision/d13be5bb-55b0-4ecc-a2c2-78f0ede8f502> <https://trivyn.io/ontologies/software/architecture#resultsIn> <https://moosedev.dev/kg/Consequence/2511863f-082d-4861-bf83-9030d08b0067> <https://moosedev.dev/kg/project> .
<https://moosedev.dev/kg/ArchitecturalDecision/d13be5bb-55b0-4ecc-a2c2-78f0ede8f502> <https://trivyn.io/ontologies/software/architecture#resultsIn> <https://moosedev.dev/kg/Consequence/f11de17a-4b4f-4299-b1ef-28b393880693> <https://moosedev.dev/kg/project> .
<https://moosedev.dev/kg/ArchitecturalDecision/d13be5bb-55b0-4ecc-a2c2-78f0ede8f502> <https://trivyn.io/ontologies/software/architecture#weighs> <https://moosedev.dev/kg/Alternative/cbb7c36a-bfb4-4a55-80da-b765e0a3d16c> <https://moosedev.dev/kg/project> .
<https://moosedev.dev/kg/ArchitecturalDecision/d146ae24-1f0b-4ae7-a3e6-9bfef97d98e1> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <https://trivyn.io/ontologies/software/architecture#ArchitecturalDecision> <https://moosedev.dev/kg/project> .
<https://moosedev.dev/kg/ArchitecturalDecision/d146ae24-1f0b-4ae7-a3e6-9bfef97d98e1> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "Retract as in-place deprecate plus rationale" <https://moosedev.dev/kg/project> .
<https://moosedev.dev/kg/ArchitecturalDecision/d146ae24-1f0b-4ae7-a3e6-9bfef97d98e1> <https://trivyn.io/ontologies/software/architecture#hasAuthor> "claude-code" <https://moosedev.dev/kg/project> .
<https://moosedev.dev/kg/ArchitecturalDecision/d146ae24-1f0b-4ae7-a3e6-9bfef97d98e1> <https://trivyn.io/ontologies/software/architecture#hasDescription> "Satisfies Requirement/1ae3b79a (add an in-place status/retract transition for knowledge records). graph::retract_decision atomically mints a Rationale (the why), links the target hasRationale→rationale, and flips the target's hasLifecycleStatus to 'deprecated', then invalidates the entity index. Chose status 'deprecated' because the read path already hides superseded/deprecated by default and surfaces them under include_history — so no read-path change was needed. Distinct from supersede_decision: retract records NO replacement; it is the 'this entry no longer applies' transition (e.g. a duplicate, or a decision abandoned with no successor). The InformationRecord precondition is now a shared require_information_record helper used by both supersede and retract. New MCP tool retract_decision(iri, rationale). Verified by tests/retract.rs (3 tests); clippy clean. Motivated concretely by two duplicate records mistakenly captured during the M4 bootstrap dry-run (a recall-first slip; see tasks/lessons.md)." <https://moosedev.dev/kg/project> .
<https://moosedev.dev/kg/ArchitecturalDecision/d146ae24-1f0b-4ae7-a3e6-9bfef97d98e1> <https://trivyn.io/ontologies/software/architecture#hasLifecycleStatus> "accepted" <https://moosedev.dev/kg/project> .
<https://moosedev.dev/kg/ArchitecturalDecision/d146ae24-1f0b-4ae7-a3e6-9bfef97d98e1> <https://trivyn.io/ontologies/software/architecture#hasTimestamp> "2026-06-18T06:05:08.946014Z"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#dateTime> <https://moosedev.dev/kg/project> .
<https://moosedev.dev/kg/ArchitecturalDecision/d146ae24-1f0b-4ae7-a3e6-9bfef97d98e1> <https://trivyn.io/ontologies/software/architecture#hasTitle> "Implement retract as in-place deprecate + rationale (no replacement)" <https://moosedev.dev/kg/project> .
