<https://moosedev.dev/kg/ArchitecturalDecision/d52505d4-69c1-4e1f-8ece-a2f97f3e917b> <https://trivyn.io/ontologies/software/architecture#weighs> <https://moosedev.dev/kg/Alternative/4ae630f1-3297-42da-9fe1-53a25668f94f> <https://moosedev.dev/kg/project> .
