<https://moosedev.dev/kg/ArchitecturalDecision/e383ce9c-160f-4fca-95c2-5d3ce3ea0b61> <https://trivyn.io/ontologies/software/architecture#weighs> <https://moosedev.dev/kg/Alternative/4717f20b-4f74-4f1c-bd5f-42c9787d4461> <https://moosedev.dev/kg/project> .
