<https://moosedev.dev/kg/ArchitecturalDecision/e995492f-7cee-4261-981f-724fd048d220> <https://trivyn.io/ontologies/software/architecture#hasAuthor> "codex-mcp-client" <https://moosedev.dev/kg/project> .
<https://moosedev.dev/kg/ArchitecturalDecision/e995492f-7cee-4261-981f-724fd048d220> <https://trivyn.io/ontologies/software/architecture#hasDescription> "Claim: high-stakes supersession reuses the existing project-graph lifecycle. The proposed replacement and rationale carry their selected semantic, supersedes, inverse, and rationale links directly; proposed and rejected nodes plus every incident edge are removed from authoritative MCP recall and NL-query projections. Acceptance atomically changes replacement, rationale, and predecessor statuses. This preserves GROWL-compatible inverse traversal without new ontology vocabulary or reified relation staging." <https://moosedev.dev/kg/project> .
<https://moosedev.dev/kg/ArchitecturalDecision/e995492f-7cee-4261-981f-724fd048d220> <https://trivyn.io/ontologies/software/architecture#hasLifecycleStatus> "accepted" <https://moosedev.dev/kg/project> .
