<https://moosedev.dev/kg/ArchitecturalDecision/fb3b96b0-b8c4-44fe-8bd8-6b06d7feb8d7> <https://trivyn.io/ontologies/software/architecture#hasAuthor> "claude-code" <https://moosedev.dev/kg/project> .
<https://moosedev.dev/kg/ArchitecturalDecision/fb3b96b0-b8c4-44fe-8bd8-6b06d7feb8d7> <https://trivyn.io/ontologies/software/architecture#hasDescription> "Claim: the v2.0 read-only vertical slice passes its spec §7 acceptance gate on the freshly re-indexed artifact (commit 390b4b1, dual-producer rust-analyzer + scip-typescript, 146 docs / 12011 defs). Verified on the artifact per Lesson 6fe1a3bd, not a green run. Evidence: (2) resolver — substrate_resolver 3/3; 40/40 SCIP positions PASS (bar ≥38), 10/10 tree-sitter fallback (mode==TreeSitter), dual-producer load did not skip; the crate-version roll to 0.7.0 was absorbed by the suffix-stable fixture (Constraint 00b3986e). (3) silence — repo_substrate_hover/diagnostics green; src/lib.rs and token-less positions publish nothing (is_synthetic_whole_file_marker, the AD ab379ef4 fix). (4) severity ceiling — only INFORMATION/HINT constructed; assert_severity_ceiling green across 14 diagnostics tests; publish() gate hardened from a release-compiled-out debug_assert to a runtime retain+warn. (5) rename→IRI continuity — on a real rebuild, position-shifted defs (build_server 65→66, build_state 73→74) keep byte-identical SCIP symbols → same continuant IRIs; a renamed def yields a new symbol and orphans the old (never rebinds); mint mechanism green (rename/update_path/repo_substrate_plan_counts). (1) ≥10 linked-entity dossiers — 25 enumerated spanning SCIP-Rust, SCIP-TypeScript (RecordPage), tree-sitter (render); by-IRI dossiers pre-verified; hover==render_markdown(get_entity_dossier) proven by lsp_hover. REMAINING: the in-editor Zed visual hover confirmation on ≥10 entities is the single manual step, pending user sign-off. Realizes the four-phase delivery AD 52554569." <https://moosedev.dev/kg/project> .
