<https://moosedev.dev/kg/ArchitecturalDecision/fec5979e-1187-4efe-9d1e-8c28632727d9> <https://trivyn.io/ontologies/software/architecture#hasDescription> "Claim: MOOSEDev is a free, domain-specific proof of concept for the underlying MOOSE neurosymbolic engine; it is not being positioned as the commercial agent-memory product. Commercial systems such as Glen validate and productize the agent-memory concept, while MOOSEDev demonstrates how MOOSE can implement that concept with structured, symbolic, auditable project knowledge. Product comparisons may illuminate the category and technical trade-offs, but they must not convert Glen's commercial productization work into an implied MOOSEDev product roadmap or direct go-to-market competition." <https://moosedev.dev/kg/project> .
