<https://moosedev.dev/kg/Consequence/eca2db22-69b4-4a0d-95da-081560405544> <https://trivyn.io/ontologies/software/architecture#hasAuthor> "claude-code" <https://moosedev.dev/kg/project> .
<https://moosedev.dev/kg/Consequence/eca2db22-69b4-4a0d-95da-081560405544> <https://trivyn.io/ontologies/software/architecture#hasDescription> "A CodeEntity record render costs one substrate definition lookup plus a metadata probe — no file read. `Substrate::indexed_source_len` establishes the same generation-proven baseline as the full read using stat alone, so availability is decided without touching contents, and the route reads only when it is actually serving bytes. The definition lookup itself is an O(1) probe into a memoized normalized-symbol map, not a scan of the index." <https://moosedev.dev/kg/project> .
