<https://moosedev.dev/kg/Constraint/162a5530-9e96-4663-924a-0ee2e2afb647> <https://trivyn.io/ontologies/software/architecture#constrains> <https://moosedev.dev/kg/ArchitecturalDecision/642b09ba-707a-4dca-901b-453b8d702a32> <https://moosedev.dev/kg/project> .
<https://moosedev.dev/kg/Constraint/162a5530-9e96-4663-924a-0ee2e2afb647> <https://trivyn.io/ontologies/software/architecture#hasAuthor> "claude-code" <https://moosedev.dev/kg/project> .
<https://moosedev.dev/kg/Constraint/162a5530-9e96-4663-924a-0ee2e2afb647> <https://trivyn.io/ontologies/software/architecture#hasDescription> "Hard rule: plan_classify/apply_classify (src/graph/classify.rs) is a deterministic rule table over structural signals (visibility, kind, paths, generated markers), the SCIP fan-in aggregation, the churn sidecar, and graph facts (accepted constrains links) — no LLM call anywhere in the path (invariant #1: the LLM is a sensor, never the judge). Every emitted judgment carries a reproducible rule trace as evidence; identical inputs produce identical plans. If richer classification ever wants LLM assistance, it must remain optional per AD 346bb120 and its outputs must still route through the human-ratified queue." <https://moosedev.dev/kg/project> .
<https://moosedev.dev/kg/Constraint/162a5530-9e96-4663-924a-0ee2e2afb647> <https://trivyn.io/ontologies/software/architecture#hasLifecycleStatus> "accepted" <https://moosedev.dev/kg/project> .
<https://moosedev.dev/kg/Constraint/162a5530-9e96-4663-924a-0ee2e2afb647> <https://trivyn.io/ontologies/software/architecture#hasTimestamp> "2026-07-13T20:32:30.396382Z"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#dateTime> <https://moosedev.dev/kg/project> .
