<https://moosedev.dev/kg/Constraint/3c2d752d-72a4-470a-902e-a7c002d2ce8d> <https://trivyn.io/ontologies/software/architecture#hasDescription> "Claim: a replacement record receives only semantic relations explicitly asserted by the caller; `supersede_decision` must never copy the superseded record's relations automatically. Automatic copying would manufacture unauthored evidence and would preserve links that a supersession may exist specifically to change. Prior semantic links are review candidates only, including GROWL-derived inverses; lifecycle and rationale bookkeeping is excluded." <https://moosedev.dev/kg/project> .
<https://moosedev.dev/kg/Constraint/3c2d752d-72a4-470a-902e-a7c002d2ce8d> <https://trivyn.io/ontologies/software/architecture#hasLifecycleStatus> "accepted" <https://moosedev.dev/kg/project> .
