<https://moosedev.dev/kg/Constraint/66d15437-2afd-4459-9707-d7e5c5423fa6> <https://trivyn.io/ontologies/software/architecture#hasAuthor> "codex" <https://moosedev.dev/kg/project> .
<https://moosedev.dev/kg/Constraint/66d15437-2afd-4459-9707-d7e5c5423fa6> <https://trivyn.io/ontologies/software/architecture#hasDescription> "Hard rule: a Story may select, order, and summarize current accepted project knowledge, but it must not become a second source of architectural truth. Story generation and reading never mutate the project graph; recipes store only instructional metadata plus existing record IRIs and stable code symbols; authoritative claims and lifecycle state resolve at run time. Proposed records may appear only as labeled gaps. The feature introduces no Story class into the architecture or code ontologies. Symbolic rendering must remain functional without an LLM, while LLM narration is strongly recommended and remains a non-authoritative sensor over the planner-selected evidence." <https://moosedev.dev/kg/project> .
<https://moosedev.dev/kg/Constraint/66d15437-2afd-4459-9707-d7e5c5423fa6> <https://trivyn.io/ontologies/software/architecture#hasLifecycleStatus> "superseded" <https://moosedev.dev/kg/project> .
