<https://moosedev.dev/kg/Constraint/c1b8a8db-6904-4c33-a7d0-7734ad9de0ed> <https://trivyn.io/ontologies/software/architecture#concerns> <https://moosedev.dev/kg/SystemComponent/f4d2f589-8f00-4640-ae16-fbb0184cb365> <https://moosedev.dev/kg/project> .
<https://moosedev.dev/kg/Constraint/c1b8a8db-6904-4c33-a7d0-7734ad9de0ed> <https://trivyn.io/ontologies/software/architecture#constrains> <https://moosedev.dev/kg/ArchitecturalDecision/53720fee-d7ff-43d3-943f-64acff2fe112> <https://moosedev.dev/kg/project> .
<https://moosedev.dev/kg/Constraint/c1b8a8db-6904-4c33-a7d0-7734ad9de0ed> <https://trivyn.io/ontologies/software/architecture#constrains> <https://moosedev.dev/kg/CodeEntity/a9e94fb2-8408-4785-97d1-5eb6921b82a6> <https://moosedev.dev/kg/project> .
<https://moosedev.dev/kg/Constraint/c1b8a8db-6904-4c33-a7d0-7734ad9de0ed> <https://trivyn.io/ontologies/software/architecture#hasAuthor> "codex" <https://moosedev.dev/kg/project> .
<https://moosedev.dev/kg/Constraint/c1b8a8db-6904-4c33-a7d0-7734ad9de0ed> <https://trivyn.io/ontologies/software/architecture#hasDescription> "Hard rule: Story is a read-only projection over the project graph, never a second source of truth. Current working-set records may support present-tense claims. Superseded and deprecated records may appear only as explicitly labeled history, and rejected records only as rejected lifecycle events; proposed records appear only as knowledge gaps. Recipes store instructional metadata and exact existing references, not copied authoritative claims or lifecycle state. Story generation, narration, reading, curation, and grading never mutate the project graph or introduce Story ontology terms. Deterministic closure, chronology, evidence, gaps, and checks remain authoritative; LLM prose is a non-authoritative presentation sensor with complete symbolic fallback." <https://moosedev.dev/kg/project> .
<https://moosedev.dev/kg/Constraint/c1b8a8db-6904-4c33-a7d0-7734ad9de0ed> <https://trivyn.io/ontologies/software/architecture#hasLifecycleStatus> "accepted" <https://moosedev.dev/kg/project> .
