<https://moosedev.dev/kg/Constraint/ecf8f7f0-b93e-404b-b075-dc1c57c23c93> <https://trivyn.io/ontologies/software/architecture#constrains> <https://moosedev.dev/kg/ArchitecturalDecision/ec521d7d-5a08-43a7-abfa-191785e7443b> <https://moosedev.dev/kg/project> .
