<https://moosedev.dev/kg/Lesson/df808a17-3593-4c1b-9f12-5c28051cc931> <https://trivyn.io/ontologies/software/architecture#hasTimestamp> "2026-06-23T00:56:26.164047Z"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#dateTime> <https://moosedev.dev/kg/project> .
