<https://moosedev.dev/kg/ProposedLink/fec13edf-e532-4f38-8d6a-755397466d57> <https://trivyn.io/ontologies/software/architecture#hasLifecycleStatus> "accepted" <https://moosedev.dev/kg/project> .
<https://moosedev.dev/kg/ProposedLink/fec13edf-e532-4f38-8d6a-755397466d57> <https://trivyn.io/ontologies/software/architecture#hasTimestamp> "2026-07-13T20:34:29.925842Z"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#dateTime> <https://moosedev.dev/kg/project> .
