<https://moosedev.dev/kg/ProposedLink/fec13edf-e532-4f38-8d6a-755397466d57> <https://trivyn.io/ontologies/software/code#proposesSubject> "https://moosedev.dev/kg/CodeEntity/5297efc0-5f80-450d-9684-e929191f36a2" <https://moosedev.dev/kg/project> .
