<https://moosedev.dev/kg/Requirement/38b2b469-8f37-4ddd-8ee5-82b4e44cd911> <https://trivyn.io/ontologies/software/architecture#hasDescription> "Claim: Constraint and AntiPattern replacements must default to proposed and must not displace the accepted predecessor until human ratification atomically accepts the replacement, retires the predecessor, and materializes selected semantic relations. The review surface must expose removed and added claims plus optional structured context. Rejection must leave the predecessor authoritative." <https://moosedev.dev/kg/project> .
