<https://moosedev.dev/kg/Requirement/52721e84-313e-4fa2-a26e-d6a7685e793c> <https://trivyn.io/ontologies/software/architecture#hasAuthor> "codex" <https://moosedev.dev/kg/project> .
<https://moosedev.dev/kg/Requirement/52721e84-313e-4fa2-a26e-d6a7685e793c> <https://trivyn.io/ontologies/software/architecture#hasDescription> "Claim: MOOSEDev must provide a concise human-facing Story experience that helps an experienced developer reboard into a subsystem. A Story must be available on demand even when no curated recipe exists and present three to five evidence-linked beats covering purpose, boundary, core code, governing decisions or constraints, and risks or extension points. When current authoritative graph evidence supports distinct, unambiguous options, the Story must offer one or two structured comprehension checks graded against current accepted graph relationships; otherwise it must expose the unavailable assessment as an explicit gap rather than fabricate a distractor. Matching published recipes should be preferred without blocking fresh generation." <https://moosedev.dev/kg/project> .
<https://moosedev.dev/kg/Requirement/52721e84-313e-4fa2-a26e-d6a7685e793c> <https://trivyn.io/ontologies/software/architecture#hasLifecycleStatus> "superseded" <https://moosedev.dev/kg/project> .
