<https://moosedev.dev/kg/Requirement/52721e84-313e-4fa2-a26e-d6a7685e793c> <https://trivyn.io/ontologies/software/architecture#motivates> <https://moosedev.dev/kg/ArchitecturalDecision/768665cb-8f3a-4a9b-b89b-b83903050dea> <https://moosedev.dev/kg/project> .
