<https://moosedev.dev/kg/Requirement/5c2ca0e8-8d74-4e9b-a22f-b4b9b3d07e24> <https://trivyn.io/ontologies/software/architecture#concerns> <https://moosedev.dev/kg/SystemComponent/8d48edbd-7ee2-4a52-9eac-f2a09c858637> <https://moosedev.dev/kg/project> .
<https://moosedev.dev/kg/Requirement/5c2ca0e8-8d74-4e9b-a22f-b4b9b3d07e24> <https://trivyn.io/ontologies/software/architecture#hasAuthor> "codex-mcp-client" <https://moosedev.dev/kg/project> .
<https://moosedev.dev/kg/Requirement/5c2ca0e8-8d74-4e9b-a22f-b4b9b3d07e24> <https://trivyn.io/ontologies/software/architecture#hasDescription> "The workbench must provide an instant, case-insensitive search field for generated ADR, Requirement, Lesson, and Constraint listings. A match must include the complete generated detail text plus visible list metadata, so a term such as RocksDB finds records even when it appears only in the body or relationship-derived sections. Filtering must remain local after the list loads and must not clear or reload the currently selected detail." <https://moosedev.dev/kg/project> .
