<https://moosedev.dev/kg/Requirement/62bcff1a-987c-415f-ac14-f1162a51f61f> <https://trivyn.io/ontologies/software/architecture#hasAuthor> "codex-mcp-client" <https://moosedev.dev/kg/project> .
<https://moosedev.dev/kg/Requirement/62bcff1a-987c-415f-ac14-f1162a51f61f> <https://trivyn.io/ontologies/software/architecture#hasDescription> "Claim: `supersede_decision` must accept author-chosen replacement relations in the same atomic capture and report the superseded record's semantic outgoing relations that were not reasserted. The report includes relevant GROWL-derived inverse links so callers can deliberately retain, retarget, or drop each relationship without depending on frontier-model follow-up." <https://moosedev.dev/kg/project> .
<https://moosedev.dev/kg/Requirement/62bcff1a-987c-415f-ac14-f1162a51f61f> <https://trivyn.io/ontologies/software/architecture#hasLifecycleStatus> "accepted" <https://moosedev.dev/kg/project> .
