<https://moosedev.dev/kg/Requirement/8b56c342-90f7-46b3-8667-ce76a2977883> <https://trivyn.io/ontologies/software/architecture#hasTimestamp> "2026-08-14T21:36:59.360134Z"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#dateTime> <https://moosedev.dev/kg/project> .
