<https://moosedev.dev/kg/Requirement/9327d3b1-d868-4f37-9d0d-eb7ee3f054de> <https://trivyn.io/ontologies/software/architecture#hasAuthor> "codex" <https://moosedev.dev/kg/project> .
<https://moosedev.dev/kg/Requirement/9327d3b1-d868-4f37-9d0d-eb7ee3f054de> <https://trivyn.io/ontologies/software/architecture#hasDescription> "MOOSEDev must let a human recover a coherent mental model of a current SystemComponent, InformationRecord, CodeEntity, or bounded free-form topic. A Story must deterministically assemble the subject's typed evidence closure, including direct relationships, complete supersession history, rationale, alternatives, consequences, constraints, lessons, and code anchors; present a short orientation followed by one cohesive cited account; expose a timestamped chronology, inspectable evidence, explicit knowledge gaps, and symbolic comprehension checks. Generated, draft, and published workflows remain available, and a matching published recipe is preferred without blocking fresh generation." <https://moosedev.dev/kg/project> .
<https://moosedev.dev/kg/Requirement/9327d3b1-d868-4f37-9d0d-eb7ee3f054de> <https://trivyn.io/ontologies/software/architecture#hasLifecycleStatus> "accepted" <https://moosedev.dev/kg/project> .
