<https://moosedev.dev/kg/Requirement/e46894cf-9d25-4019-9c77-2cae52c66864> <https://trivyn.io/ontologies/software/architecture#hasAuthor> "codex-mcp-client" <https://moosedev.dev/kg/project> .
<https://moosedev.dev/kg/Requirement/e46894cf-9d25-4019-9c77-2cae52c66864> <https://trivyn.io/ontologies/software/architecture#hasDescription> "Claim: Constraint and AntiPattern replacements default to proposed, remain in the existing ratification inbox, and do not displace their accepted predecessor until human acceptance atomically accepts the replacement and rationale and supersedes the predecessor. The review surface shows removed and added claims, a bounded diff, and an optional structured reason. Rejection leaves the predecessor authoritative and rejects dependent pending links." <https://moosedev.dev/kg/project> .
<https://moosedev.dev/kg/Requirement/e46894cf-9d25-4019-9c77-2cae52c66864> <https://trivyn.io/ontologies/software/architecture#hasLifecycleStatus> "accepted" <https://moosedev.dev/kg/project> .
