<https://moosedev.dev/kg/Requirement/ef049631-ecb9-4b83-91bd-0555fa09d45d> <https://trivyn.io/ontologies/software/architecture#hasAuthor> "codex" <https://moosedev.dev/kg/project> .
<https://moosedev.dev/kg/Requirement/ef049631-ecb9-4b83-91bd-0555fa09d45d> <https://trivyn.io/ontologies/software/architecture#hasDescription> "Claim: MOOSEDev must provide a concise human-facing Story experience that helps an experienced developer reboard into a subsystem. A Story must be available on demand even when no curated recipe exists, present three to five evidence-linked beats covering purpose, boundary, core code, governing decisions or constraints, and risks or extension points, then offer one or two structured comprehension checks graded against accepted graph relationships. Matching published recipes should be preferred without blocking fresh generation." <https://moosedev.dev/kg/project> .
<https://moosedev.dev/kg/Requirement/ef049631-ecb9-4b83-91bd-0555fa09d45d> <https://trivyn.io/ontologies/software/architecture#hasLifecycleStatus> "superseded" <https://moosedev.dev/kg/project> .
<https://moosedev.dev/kg/Requirement/ef049631-ecb9-4b83-91bd-0555fa09d45d> <https://trivyn.io/ontologies/software/architecture#hasTimestamp> "2026-08-13T18:23:44.262571Z"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#dateTime> <https://moosedev.dev/kg/project> .
<https://moosedev.dev/kg/Requirement/ef049631-ecb9-4b83-91bd-0555fa09d45d> <https://trivyn.io/ontologies/software/architecture#hasTitle> "Human-facing subsystem Stories" <https://moosedev.dev/kg/project> .
