<https://moosedev.dev/kg/SystemComponent/2f613260-c1fa-4d4d-9c3e-555e1833ed8c> <https://trivyn.io/ontologies/software/architecture#hasDescription> "Thin picture-frame editor stanzas under clients/: the Zed wasm shim, VS Code extension, Emacs moosedev.el (eglot + lsp-mode registrations), and the Neovim stanza with its scriptable conformance suite. All behavior lives in the daemon behind `moosedev lsp`; clients contain no logic. Evidence: clients/ tree; ADs d699f118 (thin picture-frame stanzas), 8555ceeb (broad attach from the lang registry), 20145567 (server-handled openEntity); thin-client Constraint 2ba76439." <https://moosedev.dev/kg/project> .
